2026-11-16 19:23:39,570 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {}, 'timeout': {'connect': 5.0, 'read': 600, 'write': 600, 'pool': 600}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-4ce8a369-271b-465e-b576-085783d448a9', 'span_name': 'anthropic.messages.create', 'span_route': '/v1/messages', 'span_attributes': <function messages_create_request_attributes at 0x7bb98d027100>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://cset.georgetown.edu/careers/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="main" id="main" role="main" tabindex="-1">\n<div class="l-preface">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Provided by templates/page.twig -->\n<div class="page-title">\n<div class="l-constrain">\n<div class="page-title__inner">\n<h1 class="page-title__title">Careers</h1>\n              CSET researchers and staff members are challenged with meaningful work, pursue ongoing professional development and learning, and contribute to a collegial and engaging environment where they can thrive. We are committed to fostering a culture of inclusion and encourage individuals with diverse backgrounds and experiences to apply. We especially encourage applications from women, people of color, and individuals with disabilities who are excited about contributing to our mission.\n                      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="l-constrain--small post-content">\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-or-senior-fellow-frontier-ai/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-24413" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-100.png 1600w" width="700"/></a></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><strong><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-or-senior-fellow-frontier-ai/">Frontier AI Research Lead</a> </strong></h4>\n<p class="wp-block-paragraph">CSET is currently accepting applications to lead a new team focused on Frontier AI issues.  This role will oversee the execution of research and the production of reports, including shaping priorities and outlining the overall research strategy for the team. More information on the role can be found <a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-or-senior-fellow-frontier-ai/">here.</a></p>\n<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>Applications for Frontier AI Research Lead will be reviewed on a rolling basis.</em></p>\n<hr/>\n<br/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large is-resized"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/national-security-applications-of-ai-research-lead/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-25375" decoding="async" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-1536x864.png 1536w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1-350x197.png 350w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/NATSEC-AI-1.png 1600w" style="width:700px;height:auto" width="700"/></a></figure>\n<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/national-security-applications-of-ai-research-lead/" rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank"><strong>National Security Applications of AI Research Lead</strong></a></h4>\n<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><em>The application deadline for this role has passed. Those selected to move forward will be contacted directly.</em> </p>\n<hr/>\n<br/>\n<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><a href="https://cset.georgetown.edu/job/research-analysts/" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="wp-image-24837" decoding="async" height="394" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" src="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-700x394.png" srcset="https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-700x394.png 700w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-250x141.png 250w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-768x432.png 768w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-120x68.png 120w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-150x84.png 150w, https://cset.georgetown.edu/wp-content/uploads/image-105-350x197.png 350w, http