43,2843&amp;w=2400&amp;h=2400" width="2400"/> </div> <!-- Content --> <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-[20px] px-[20px] lg:px-[80px] {className}"> <div class="flex min-h-[280px] pt-[40px] pb-[60px] text-balance items-end col-span-10 md:col-start-2"> <!-- <Component\n  class={twMerge(\n    \'text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.25rem] leading-[1.25] sm:leading-[4.5rem] font-serif text-offwhite\',\n    className\n  )}\n>\n  <slot />\n</Component> --><h1 class="text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.25rem] md:text-[3.75rem] leading-[1.25] font-serif text-offwhite"> Career Opportunities </h1> </div> </div> </div> <section class="bg-offwhite relative py-[60px] md:py-[80px]"> <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-[20px] px-[20px] lg:px-[80px] {className}"> <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2" data-astro-cid-fzx4jmue=""> <div data-astro-cid-fzx4jmue=""> <div class="min-w-0 max-w-[65ch] text-[1.125rem]" data-astro-cid-fzx4jmue=""> <article class="prose prose-lg" data-astro-cid-fzx4jmue=""> <p class="text-textgray text-[16px] leading-[24px] md:text-[20px] md:leading-[32px]">Stay tuned for opportunities coming soon.</p><h3 class="text-[1.25rem] md:text-[1.5rem] leading-[1.75rem] md:leading-[2rem] font-serif text-textgray mb-4" id="why-work-with-us">Why work with us</h3><p class="text-textgray text-[16px] leading-[24px] md:text-[20px] md:leading-[32px]">We develop and advocate for pragmatic policies to reduce risks of severe harm from advanced AI. Thus far, we’ve worked very closely with state legislators to pass some of the most comprehensive AI safety bills in the country: <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2025/09/29/technology/california-ai-safety-law.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">SB 53</a> in CA, the <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2025/12/19/nyregion/ai-bill-regulations-ny.html" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">RAISE Act</a> in NY, <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://www.nbcnews.com/tech/tech-news/illinois-legislature-passes-historic-ai-bill-rcna347191" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">SB 315</a> in IL, and <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://leginfo.legislature.ca.gov/faces/billTextClient.xhtml?bill_id=202520260AB1864" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">AB 1864</a> in CA. These laws apply to everyone doing business in CA, NY, and IL which includes all major AI developers. You can read more about bills we have supported <a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline underline-offset-4" href="https://secureaiproject.org/bills-we-support/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">here</a>.</p><p class="text-textgray text-[16px] leading-[24px] md:text-[20px] md:leading-[32px]"></p> </article> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="bg-offwhite w-full h-[60px] md:h-[80px]"></div>  </main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
