2026-11-16 19:24:04,709 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {}, 'timeout': {'connect': 5.0, 'read': 600, 'write': 600, 'pool': 600}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-42727a03-bb84-4279-bb4b-77aa28511c40', 'span_name': 'anthropic.messages.create', 'span_route': '/v1/messages', 'span_attributes': <function messages_create_request_attributes at 0x7bb98d027100>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://www.alignment.org/hiring/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main class="container content" id="content">\n<article class="page post no-image page">\n\n<section class="page__content" id="jlb-content">\n<p>We are currently hiring for researchers and accepting expressions of interest for automation engineers. For questions about either of these roles, please email us at hiring@[domain].org.</p><h2 id="researcher-positions">Researcher positions</h2>\n<div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent" href="https://jobs.lever.co/alignment.org/617488b1-d742-4990-a037-b7f0e2ba68c9">Researcher</a></div><p><br/>The ARC research team is hiring!</p><p>We are primarily seeking candidates for visiting researcher positions, which we offer year-round. While visiting researcher appointments typically run for 10 weeks, we can be flexible with the duration. Most of our team members join as visiting researchers first, as this allows both sides to ensure a great fit. While we are open to hiring directly for permanent positions, this path has significantly higher requirements.</p><p>Most successful candidates have a strong theoretical background (in math, physics or computer science, for example). Empirical machine learning background is a plus, but is not required for a strong application.</p><h2 id="automation-engineer-positions">Automation engineer positions</h2>\n<div class="kg-card kg-button-card kg-align-center"><a class="kg-btn kg-btn-accent" href="https://jobs.lever.co/alignment.org/d2f48b14-e24b-4068-bc37-27e701c7ce44">Automation Engineer (expression of interest)</a></div><p><br/>We are tentatively accepting expressions of interest for automation engineers, who would work on automating ARC\'s research activities using AI. We do not currently have a concrete timeline for whether or when we would hire for this role.</p>\n</section>\n</article>\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
