2026-11-16 19:24:17,102 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {}, 'timeout': {'connect': 5.0, 'read': 600, 'write': 600, 'pool': 600}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-5f31c1de-6e21-4c6a-8f56-a84e02c069a7', 'span_name': 'anthropic.messages.create', 'span_route': '/v1/messages', 'span_attributes': <function messages_create_request_attributes at 0x7bb98d027100>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://www.adalovelaceinstitute.org/about/jobs/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main id="content">\n<article>\n\n\n<section class="c-text-block o-section">\n<div class="c-text-block__container o-container">\n<div class="c-text-block__content o-content-from-editor js-toc-content">\n<div class="column-2-3">\n<p class="is-style-large-text featured-introduction__bottom">The Ada Lovelace Institute is an agile and dynamic organisation working at the intersection of technology and society on some of the most pressing policy and technical challenges.</p>\n<p class="is-style-large-text featured-introduction__bottom">Current job vacancies, fellowships and opportunities to be involved in our governance will be listed below when available. Please note that we are not able to accept speculative CVs.</p>\n</div>\n<p>We are part of the <a href="https://www.nuffieldfoundation.org/">Nuffield Foundation</a>. If you have any questions about available positions or our application process, please email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#6d1f080e1f180419000803192d03180b0b040801090b021803090c1904020343021f0a"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="2d5f484e5f584459404843596d43584b4b444841494b425843494c5944424303425f4a">[email\xa0protected]</span></a>.</p>\n<p>We are an employer that values the diversity of its workforce and welcome applications from all sections of the community.</p>\n<p><a href="https://twitter.com/AdaLovelaceInst">Follow us on Twitter</a> or <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/66883451">LinkedIn</a> and <a href="https://t.co/lTk3R2LxwO">join our mailing list</a> to stay informed about future opportunities at Ada.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class="c-listing o-section js-filters" id="listing">\n<div class="c-listing__container o-container">\n<h2 class="c-listing__title">Current vacancies</h2>\n<div class="c-listing__filters-wrapper js-filters-mobile-wrapper">\n<div class="c-listing__filters">\n<h3 class="c-listing__filters-title">Filter by:</h3>\n<section class="c-filters js-filters">\n<form action="#listing" class="c-filters__form js-filters__form" method="get">\n<div class="c-filters__filter c-filters__filter--keywords-container js-filters__filter">\n<button class="c-filters__filter__heading js-filters__filter__heading" type="button">\n                Keywords<span class="c-filters__filter__heading__icon"></span>\n</button>\n<ul class="c-filters__filter__list c-filters__filter__list--keywords js-filters__filter__list">\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox accountability-mechanisms js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-accountability-mechanisms" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="accountability-mechanisms"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__filter__list__item__label" for="keywords-accountability-mechanisms">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAccountability mechanisms\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n</li>\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox ai-and-data-ethics js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-ai-and-data-ethics" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="ai-and-data-ethics"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__filter__list__item__label" for="keywords-ai-and-data-ethics">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAI and data ethics\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n</li>\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox ai-bias js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-ai-bias" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="ai-bias"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__filter__list__item__label" for="keywords-ai-bias">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAI bias\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n</li>\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox ai-policy js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-ai-policy" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="ai-policy"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__filter__list__item__label" for="keywords-ai-policy">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAI policy\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n</li>\n<li class="c-filters__filter__list__item c-filters__filter__list__item--checkbox contact-tracing js-filters__filter__list__item">\n<input class="c-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox js-filters__filter__list__item__checkbox" id="keywords-contact-tracing" name="select-keywords[]" type="checkbox" value="contact-tracing"/>\n<label class="c-filters__filter__list__item__label js-filters__fi