div><div class="screen-reader-only"><div>system card opens in new tab</div></div></a></div><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="card smaller link-card text-link-no-underline w-inline-block" data-featured="false" data-w-id="5f17ee1e-020d-2882-877f-f0e16176727a" href="https://cdn.openai.com/o3-mini-system-card-feb10.pdf" target="_blank"><div class="model-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/6ac3c59938c0638490690109_OpenAI_Logo_Padded_Tight.svg" width="124"/></div><div class="card-link-external"><h3 class="heading-xs align-center justify-center card-text-link">o3 mini</h3></div><div class="screen-reader-only"><div>system card opens in new tab</div></div></a></div><div class="w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><a class="card smaller link-card text-link-no-underline w-inline-block" data-featured="false" data-w-id="5f17ee1e-020d-2882-877f-f0e16176727a" href="https://cdn.openai.com/o1-system-card-20241205.pdf" target="_blank"><div class="model-logo-wrapper"><img alt="" class="model-logo" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6614467b00e631b0f073e2be/6ac3c59938c0638490690109_OpenAI_Logo_Padded_Tight.svg" width="124"/></div><div class="card-link-external"><h3 class="heading-xs align-center justify-center card-text-link">o1</h3></div><div class="screen-reader-only"><div>system card opens in new tab</div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"></div></div><div class="padding-sm"></div><div class="button-wrapper align-center"><a class="button is-secondary-brand align-center show-models-btn w-button" href="#">Show More</a></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div></div><div class="padding-global"></div></section></section><section><section class="section bg-c-gray900" id="products"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="w-layout-grid _2x-grid _30-70"><div id="w-node-_4a238c86-b46a-72f1-855b-50e83107cb49-d72d58a1"><div class="padding-xl"></div><div class="sticky"><h2 class="heading-medium t-c-white">Small Team. Outsized Impact.</h2><div class="padding-xs"></div><div><p class="t-c-white">As a Swan, individual work matters, immediately.</p><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="button-wrapper portrait-full"><a class="button is-primary-brand w-inline-block" href="#open-positions"><div>View Open Positions</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Model Metrics</div></a><a class="text-link-background portrait-half hide w-inline-block" href="#"><div class="t-c-white">Pricing</div></a></div></div><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div></div></div><div class="column gap-0"><div class="left-border-card-wrapper full-height"><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div><div class="border-left is-yellow"></div><div class="rtf-white w-richtext"><p class="text-primary">Your work helps shape how AI is deployed, evaluated, and trusted; from enterprises shipping to production, to researchers pushing new capabilities, to organizations responsible for safety at scale.</p></div><div class="padding-xs"></div><div class="rtf-white w-richtext"><p class="text-primary">This is work with real consequences. Looking for a place where your thinking carries weight and where progress is measured in outcomes, not meetings? <strong>You’ll find it here.</strong></p></div><div class="padding-xl hide-tablet"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section class="section-7"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_096ccd17-9373-8cda-aef6-e666105c0ac3-d72d58a1"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Support That Lets You Do Your Best Work</h2><p>Our benefits are designed to support real life, sustained curiosity, and the kind of deep work that meaningful impact requires.</p></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-sm"><div class="_2x-grid landscape"><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>28 days off between holidays &amp;\xa0PTO:\xa0</strong>Time off that actually feels like time off.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>401(k) with up to 4% matching: </strong>We invest in the long term; yours included.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Flexible work arrangements: </strong>We care about outcomes, not where your laptop happens to be.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Professional development support: </strong>Learning isn’t optional here. We make room for it.</li></ul></div><div class="card shadow"><ul class="list" role="list"><li class="list-item"><strong>Medical, dental, and vision coverage: </strong>Comprehensive coverage, because your health isn’t a side project.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Catered lunches (Pittsburgh office): </strong>Good food, fewer decisions, better afternoons.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Visa sponsorship</strong>:<strong> </strong>Great work knows no borders. We’ll help with the paperwork.</li><li class="list-item"><strong>Short-term disability &amp; parental support: </strong>100% paid, including parental leave, with up to 14 weeks of paid birthing leave. So you can focus on what matters most.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-lg"></div></div></section><section id="open-positions"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="max-width-large align-center" id="w-node-_4b80b22b-42ff-875c-a016-a3c601446255-d72d58a1"><div class="column align-center text-align-center"><h2 class="heading-medium">Do the Work That Matters</h2><p>If you’re excited by meaningful problems, real responsibility, and work that shows up in the world, you’ll fit right in. Take a look at our open roles below.</p></div></div><div class="w-embed"><div id="ashby_embed"></div></div><div class="padding-vertical padding-md"></div></div></section><section class="newsletter-bg overflow-hidden" id="joinNewsletter"><div class="padding-global relative"><div class="container-large"><div class="padding-lg"></div><div class="div-block-89"><div class="div-block-90"><h2 class="heading-medium">Join our newsletter</h2><div class="padding-xxs"></div><p class="textwrap-balance">Keep up to date on all things Gray Swan and AI\xa0Security.</p></div><div class="form-div"><div><div class="w-embed w-script">\n</div></div></div></div><div class="padding-md"></div></div></div></section><div class="w-embed w-script"></div>\n\n\n</body>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
