ne tablet:text-headlineH4Display">The Carnegie Endowment is a community of more than 300 people across twenty countries who offer policymakers independent insights that advance international peace.</h2></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col white-scheme bg-blanc"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[144rem] px-[2.4rem] desktop:px-[6rem] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[2.4rem] desktop:grid-cols-12 pt-[6.4rem] pb-[6.4rem] items-start"><div class="row-100 col-span-1 tablet:col-span-12"><div class="cms-html payload-richtext"><p>Do you have an international outlook? Are you interested in advancing ideas that help decisionmakers navigate a crowded, chaotic, and contested world? If so, review the opportunities below to become part of our global network. Offering competitive pay and generous benefits, the Carnegie Endowment ensures staff can grow professionally, expand their opportunities, and pursue their interests in a vibrant, diverse, and inclusive global community.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col white-scheme bg-blanc"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[144rem] px-[2.4rem] desktop:px-[6rem] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[2.4rem] desktop:grid-cols-12 pt-[6.4rem] pb-[-6.4rem] items-start"><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><figure class="relative flex max-w-full items-center flex-col" id="6601d6ff6313bc0001ed8234"><img alt="" class="aspect-auto" data-nimg="1" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" src="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtQ2FyZWVyLnBuZyJ9" srcset="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtQ2FyZWVyLnBuZyJ9 1x, https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtQ2FyZWVyLnBuZyJ9 2x" style="color:transparent" width="800"/></figure></div><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><figure class="relative flex max-w-full items-center flex-col" id="6601d6ff6313bc0001ed8235"><img alt="" class="aspect-auto" data-nimg="1" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" src="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSnVuaW9yRmVsbG93cy5wbmcifQ==" srcset="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSnVuaW9yRmVsbG93cy5wbmcifQ== 1x, https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSnVuaW9yRmVsbG93cy5wbmcifQ== 2x" style="color:transparent" width="800"/></figure></div><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><figure class="relative flex max-w-full items-center flex-col" id="6601d6ff6313bc0001ed8236"><img alt="" class="aspect-auto" data-nimg="1" decoding="async" height="800" loading="lazy" src="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSW50ZXJuc2hpcHMucG5nIn0=" srcset="https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSW50ZXJuc2hpcHMucG5nIn0= 1x, https://assets.carnegieendowment.org/_/eyJrZXkiOiJzdGF0aWMvbWVkaWEvaW1hZ2VzL0Fib3V0VXMtSW50ZXJuc2hpcHMucG5nIn0= 2x" style="color:transparent" width="800"/></figure></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col white-scheme bg-blanc"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[144rem] px-[2.4rem] desktop:px-[6rem] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[2.4rem] desktop:grid-cols-12 pt-[6.4rem] pb-[6.4rem] items-start"><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><h2 class="w-full pb-[1.6rem] font-serif text-offNoir dark:text-blanc row-100:mx-auto row-100:max-w-[104rem] row-100:tablet:text-center text-headlineH4DisplayPhone tablet:text-headlineH4Display">Employment</h2><div class="flex text-noir/70 dark:text-blanc/70 row-100:justify-center row-100:tablet:text-center w-full"><div class="cms-html payload-richtext"><p>We have opportunities in research, management, administration, communications, IT, fundraising, and more. Current employment openings can be found using the search feature below. Please note we accept resumes for posted positions only. Unsolicited resumes are not retained. The Carnegie Endowment is an equal opportunity employer.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 pt-[2.6rem] row-100:mx-auto row-100:mt-[1.6rem] row-100:max-w-[60rem] row-100:justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-button sm:w-full group inline-flex items-center justify-center disabled:opacity-40 transition-colors duration-200 rounded-button uppercase p-button gap-[.8rem] border border-teal hover:border-tealHover active:border-tealActive text-blue/70 hover:text-tealHover active:text-blueDark dark:hover:text-blanc dark:active:text-blanc grey-scheme:text-blue70 max-w-fit dark:text-blanc/70" href="http://carnegieendowment.applicantpro.com/">Search current opportunities</a></div></div><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><h2 class="w-full pb-[1.6rem] font-serif text-offNoir dark:text-blanc row-100:mx-auto row-100:max-w-[104rem] row-100:tablet:text-center text-headlineH4DisplayPhone tablet:text-headlineH4Display">James C. Gaither Junior Fellows Program</h2><div class="flex text-noir/70 dark:text-blanc/70 row-100:justify-center row-100:tablet:text-center w-full"><div class="cms-html payload-richtext"><p>The Carnegie Endowment offers approximately fifteen one-year fellowships to uniquely qualified graduating seniors and individuals who have graduated during the past academic year. This diverse cohort of fellows work as research assistants to Carnegie’s senior scholars.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 pt-[2.6rem] row-100:mx-auto row-100:mt-[1.6rem] row-100:max-w-[60rem] row-100:justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-button sm:w-full group inline-flex items-center justify-center disabled:opacity-40 transition-colors duration-200 rounded-button uppercase p-button gap-[.8rem] border border-teal hover:border-tealHover active:border-tealActive text-blue/70 hover:text-tealHover active:text-blueDark dark:hover:text-blanc dark:active:text-blanc grey-scheme:text-blue70 max-w-fit dark:text-blanc/70" href="/james-c-gaither-junior-fellows-program">Learn More</a></div></div><div class="row-33 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-4"><h2 class="w-full pb-[1.6rem] font-serif text-offNoir dark:text-blanc row-100:mx-auto row-100:max-w-[104rem] row-100:tablet:text-center text-headlineH4DisplayPhone tablet:text-headlineH4Display">Internships</h2><div class="flex text-noir/70 dark:text-blanc/70 row-100:justify-center row-100:tablet:text-center w-full"><div class="cms-html payload-richtext"><p>Carnegie offers several different types of internship opportunities across its global research network. These opportunities range from internships supporting our wide variety of research programs to internships supporting functional areas such as communications, development, and operations. Internships at Carnegie vary by center.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 pt-[2.6rem] row-100:mx-auto row-100:mt-[1.6rem] row-100:max-w-[60rem] row-100:justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-button sm:w-full group inline-flex items-center justify-center disabled:opacity-40 transition-colors duration-200 rounded-button uppercase p-button gap-[.8rem] border border-teal hover:border-tealHover active:border-tealActive text-blue/70 hover:text-tealHover active:text-blueDark dark:hover:text-blanc dark:active:text-blanc grey-scheme:text-blue70 max-w-fit dark:text-blanc/70" href="/internships-at-the-carnegie-endowment-for-international-peace">Learn More</a></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col grey-scheme bg-offBlanc"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[144rem] px-[2.4rem] desktop:px-[6rem] grid grid-cols-1 gap-[2.4rem] desktop:grid-cols-12 pt-[6.4rem] pb-[6.4rem] items-start"><div class="row-100 col-span-1 tablet:col-span-12"><h2 class="w-full pb-[1.6rem] font-serif text-offNoir dark:text-blanc row-100:mx-auto row-100:max-w-[104rem] row-100:tablet:text-center text-headlineH3DisplayPhone tablet:text-headlineH3Display">Diversity at the Carnegie Endowment</h2><div class="flex text-noir/70 dark:text-blanc/70 row-100:justify-center row-100:tablet:text-center w-full"><div class="cms-html payload-richtext"><p>As an organization dedicated to pursuing global engagement and peace, we believe our work is enriched and should be informed by a diverse array of perspectives. We are committed to building an inclusive community among staff and partners and on our public platform.</p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-row flex-wrap gap-4 pt-[2.6rem] row-100:mx-auto row-100:mt-[1.6rem] row-100:max-w-[60rem] row-100:justify-center"><a class="font-mono text-button sm:w-full group inline-flex items-center justify-center disabled:opacity-40 transition-colors duration-200 rounded-button uppercase p-button text-blanc80 gap-[.8rem] bg-teal hover:bg-tealHover group-hover:text-blanc active:bg-tealActive grey-scheme:text-blue70 max-w-fit dark:text-blanc/70" href="/equal-opportunity">Learn More</a></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col white-scheme bg-blanc"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-[2.4rem] desktop:grid-cols-12 items-start"><div class="row-100 col-span-1 desktop:col-span-12"><div class="bg-blanc @container print:hidden"><div class="flex flex-col tablet:flex-row"><div class="flex p-[2.4rem] tablet:items-center tablet:basis-2/3 @[73.8rem]:p-32"><div class="mx-auto flex flex-col gap-4 text-center tablet:text-start"><div class="relative max-w-prose pt-[2.4rem] font-serif text-headlineH2Display"><span class="absolute start-1/2 top-0 h-[0.5rem] w-[4.8rem] bg-teal max-tablet:-translate-x-1/2 tablet:start-0"></span><em class="text-noir/60">Get more news and analysis from</em><br/><span>Carnegie This Week</span></div><div class="cms-html text-noir/70 text-[1.8rem] payload-richtext"><p>Understand the world with the latest from our scholars around the world.</p></div><div><form class="w-full space-y-6"><div class="flex flex-col space-y-2"><label class="text-formLabel dark:text-blanc tex