site" type="text"/> <button aria-label="Search" type="submit"><i class="icon-search-bold"><span>Search</span></i></button> </p> </form> </div> </div> </div><!-- /drawer1 -->\n<section class="content1" id="content">\n<div class="wrap1 -top1 component_hero_basic -p:s -mt:2">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<!-- /header1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n<div class="wrap1 component_wysiwyg">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<div class="body1 -contain -wx:5">\n<p dir="ltr">At New America, our values guide our work and our commitment to meaningful impact. Supporting our people is central to that commitment. We offer a comprehensive rewards package designed to foster well-being and growth, including competitive, market-aligned compensation; health and wellness benefits; generous paid time off; and leave programs. All benefits are subject to eligibility requirements detailed in our policies.</p>\n<p dir="ltr">If purpose-driven work excites you and you want to help shape what’s next, explore our current openings and join us.</p>\n</div><!-- /body1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n<div class="wrap1 component_wysiwyg">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<div class="body1 -contain -wx:5">\n<div class="single-job">\n<h6 class="job-title">\n<a href="https://www.newamerica.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Chief-Executive-Officer-JD_New-America_2026.pdf" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Chief Executive Officer</a>\n</h6>\n<div class="job-details">\n<div class="job-inline -t:19 -c:d2t">\n<div class="inline">Location:</div>\n<div class="inline">\n                                Washington, DC\n                            </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="single-job">\n<h6 class="job-title">\n<a href="https://newamerica.applytojob.com/apply/AcJpJASoMF/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Digital Director</a>\n</h6>\n<div class="job-details">\n<div class="job-inline -t:19 -c:d2t">\n<div class="inline">Location:</div>\n<div class="inline">\n                                Washington, DC                            </div>\n</div>\n<div class="job-inline -t:19 -c:d2t">\n<div class="inline">Department:</div>\n<div class="inline">Central Communications</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class="single-job">\n<h6 class="job-title">\n<a href="https://newamerica.applytojob.com/apply/1W2O6UxTLY/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Senior Visual Designer and Brand Lead</a>\n</h6>\n<div class="job-details">\n<div class="job-inline -t:19 -c:d2t">\n<div class="inline">Location:</div>\n<div class="inline">\n                                Washington, DC                            </div>\n</div>\n<div class="job-inline -t:19 -c:d2t">\n<div class="inline">Department:</div>\n<div class="inline">Central Communications</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><!-- /body1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n<div class="wrap1 component_heading -my:0">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<div class="body1 -contain -wx:5">\n<h3>Open Call for Contractors</h3>\n</div><!-- /body1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n<div class="wrap1 component_wysiwyg">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<div class="body1 -contain -wx:5">\n<p>Interested in contributing to New America’s mission through project-based consulting work?</p>\n<p>New America periodically partners with independent consultants and contractors who bring specialized expertise, project-based support, and additional capacity to our programs and operational teams. These opportunities are paid project-based consulting opportunities, not employment positions, and may vary based on organizational needs.</p>\n<p>To express interest in future consulting opportunities with New America, please complete this form. As project needs arise, your information may be reviewed by New America staff across different departments. You will only be contacted if your background, expertise, availability, and services appear to align with a specific project need.</p>\n</div><!-- /body1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n<div class="wrap1 component_button">\n<div class="wrap1-inner -restrain">\n<div class="body1 -contain -wx:5">\n<p><a class="button1" href="https://airtable.com/appiyKpOPhsau9sVX/shrCwqROPF8lRMhB3" role="button" target="_blank"><span>Apply Now</span></a></p>\n</div><!-- /body1 -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- /wrap1 -->\n</section>\n\n<div @keydown.escape.window="$store.app.states.sidenav = false;" class="sidenav1 -cs:b3 -cs:i" id="sidenav" x-bind="transitions" x-cloak="" x-data="collapse()" x-show="$store.app.states.sidenav"> <div aria-hidden="true" class="decor1 -c:a5 -x5"> <div class="decor1-wrap"> <i class="icon-flag"></i> </div> </div><!-- /decor1 --> <div class="sidenav1-header"> <p class="sidenav1-close -as:0"><a @click.prevent="$store.app.states.sidenav = false" aria-label="Close" class="icon-close-bold" href="#"><span>Close</span></a></p> </div> <div class="sidenav1-wrap"> <ul class="sidenav1-main"> <li :class="{ \'-open\': open[\'m1\'] }"> <span> <i @click.prevent="toggle(\'m1\')" @keydown.enter="toggle(\'m1\')" class="icon-angle-down-bold" clickable="" scripted="" tabindex="0"></i> <a href="/issues/">Issues</a> </span> <ul class="sidenav1-drop" cloaked="" collapse="" x-bind="transitions" x-show="show(open[\'m1\'])"> <li><a href="/issues/education-and-work/">Education &amp; Work</a></li> <li><a href="/issues/democratic-futures/">Democratic Futures</a></li> <li><a href="/issues/thriving-families/">Thriving Families</a></li> <li><a href="/issues/global-security/">Global Security</a></li> <li><a href="/issues/technology-democracy/">Technology &amp; Democracy</a></li> </ul> </li> <li :class="{ \'-open\': open[\'m2\'] }"> <span> <a href="/latest/">Latest</a> </span> </li> <li :class="{ \'-open\': open[\'m3\'] }"> <span> <a href="/impact/">Impact</a> </span> </li> <li :class="{ \'-open\': open[\'m4\'] }"> <span> <i @click.prevent="toggle(\'m4\')" @keydown.enter="toggle(\'m4\')" class="icon-angle-down-bold" clickable="" scripted="" tabindex="0