2026-11-16 19:26:22,807 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'headers': {}, 'timeout': {'connect': 5.0, 'read': 600, 'write': 600, 'pool': 600}, 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-80676a66-ee97-4672-992e-796d4dbf042b', 'span_name': 'anthropic.messages.create', 'span_route': '/v1/messages', 'span_attributes': <function messages_create_request_attributes at 0x7bb98d027100>, 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://www.techcongress.io/)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<main id="page" role="main">\n<!--\n--><!--\n--><!--\n--><div class="main-content" data-collection-id="552c5d3ee4b053984d8d3556" data-content-field="main-content" data-edit-main-image="" id="content">\n<div class="sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12" data-type="page" data-updated-on="1793037766487" id="page-552c5d3ee4b053984d8d3556"><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-12 span-12"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_6_1514937205661_10170" id="block-yui_3_17_2_6_1514937205661_10170"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">\n<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content=""><h1 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;">Upskilling Government with Tech Talent</h1></div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-2 span-2"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a8376ff5-9118-474d-8e11-1665a32830cf_1387/website.components.spacer.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a8376ff5-9118-474d-8e11-1665a32830cf_1387/website.components.spacer.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.spacer" data-website-component-id="3f0aecaba7151fa7367c" id="block-3f0aecaba7151fa7367c"><div class="sqs-block-content">\xa0</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-8 span-8"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="9b68428d3dc4235f06c2" id="block-9b68428d3dc4235f06c2"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">\n<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content=""><p class="" style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;">Technology touches virtually all areas of life and every issue before Congress. TechCongress gives talented technologists the opportunity to gain first-\xadhand experience in federal policymaking and shape the future of tech policy through our fellowships with Members of Congress and Congressional Committees.</p><p class="" style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>We’re proud to have had fellows serve under House Speaker Nancy Pelosi (D-CA), Senate Majority Leader John Thune (R-SD), Senator Tim Scott (R-SC), Senator Elizabeth Warren (D-MA), Senator Amy Klobuchar (D-MN), Senator Tom Cotton (R-AR) and others.</em></p></div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-2 span-2"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a8376ff5-9118-474d-8e11-1665a32830cf_1387/website.components.spacer.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.spacer/a8376ff5-9118-474d-8e11-1665a32830cf_1387/website.components.spacer.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.spacer" data-website-component-id="ee21fe402d941b112f04" id="block-ee21fe402d941b112f04"><div class="sqs-block-content">\xa0</div></div></div></div><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-horizontalrule horizontalrule-block" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/39b1172f-96f9-47fd-bfb1-bfaf513f0ff8_431/website.components.horizontalrule.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.horizontalrule/39b1172f-96f9-47fd-bfb1-bfaf513f0ff8_431/website.components.horizontalrule.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.horizontalrule" data-sqsp-block="line" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1614976867934_34810" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1614976867934_34810"><div class="sqs-block-content">\n<div>\n<hr/>\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class="row sqs-row"><div class="col sqs-col-4 span-4"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.styles.css"]\' data-block-scripts=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/4e4a9578-db24-46e6-a33a-510b3e010644_1064/website.components.html.visitor.js"]\' data-block-type="1337" data-definition-name="website.components.html" data-sqsp-block="text" data-website-component-id="yui_3_17_2_1_1614976867934_9862" id="block-yui_3_17_2_1_1614976867934_9862"><div class="sqs-block-content"><div class="sqs-text-block-container">\n<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content=""><h1 style="text-align:center;white-space:pre-wrap;"><em>“Serving the First Branch has been </em><a href="https://www.techcongress.io/blog/2019/2/20/2018-fellow-reflections-james-gimbi"><em>the highlight of my career</em></a><em>.” <br/>-James Gimbi, 2018 fellow, Sen. Rand Paul (R-KY)<br/></em></h1></div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div><div class="col sqs-col-3 span-3"><div class="sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-spacer spacer-block sized vsize-1" data-block-css=\'["https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.sp